  "content": [
    {
      "children": [],
      "block": {
        "type": "Paragraph",
        "id": "cBCE_2CU",
        "revision": "bafyreia7bwnixljpmmhubsrorscx3aua5k5i4f642pgvp4tywxsvlgga6a",
        "attributes": {},
        "annotations": [],
        "text": "This week was about making Seed feel safer and more practical in day-to-day publishing: fewer dead ends in the editor, clearer desktop navigation, and a stronger release pipeline for Windows builds.",
        "link": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "block": {
            "type": "Paragraph",
            "id": "7I3EB-k8",
            "revision": "bafyreia7bwnixljpmmhubsrorscx3aua5k5i4f642pgvp4tywxsvlgga6a",
            "attributes": {},
            "annotations": [
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [208],
                "ends": [215],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/797"
              },
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [217],
                "ends": [224],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/horacioh/seed/commit/1f8fd7b75c1196e88dc583b734f2b3057f13805b"
              },
              {
                "type": "Code",
                "starts": [224, 245],
                "ends": [232, 253],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": ""
              },
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [238],
                "ends": [245],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/horacioh/seed/commit/7d84ca5202e990ff1697a39718060e54bdb514cf"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Simplified document sharing and cleanup on desktop: the Share menu became “Copy link”, deleted cards are removed more reliably, and embed card clicks route through the same document-card navigation path. See PR #797, commit 1f8fd7b7, and commit 7d84ca52.",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [],
          "block": {
            "type": "Paragraph",
            "id": "0xCKqzV6",
            "revision": "bafyreia7bwnixljpmmhubsrorscx3aua5k5i4f642pgvp4tywxsvlgga6a",
            "attributes": {},
            "annotations": [
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [192],
                "ends": [199],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/804"
              },
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [201],
                "ends": [208],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/805"
              },
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [210],
                "ends": [217],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/806"
              },
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [223],
                "ends": [230],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/horacioh/seed/commit/6affde90519c8547ff92c4c448ac0d34d2bb3f2a"
              },
              {
                "type": "Code",
                "starts": [230],
                "ends": [238],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": ""
              }
            ],
            "text": "Polished desktop chrome: video controls now apply to actual players, the titlebar aligns with the locked sidebar width, bookmark labels truncate cleanly, and tabs can show a people count. See PR #804, PR #805, PR #806, and commit 6affde90.",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [],
          "block": {
            "type": "Paragraph",
            "id": "S2zg8fpG",
            "revision": "bafyreia7bwnixljpmmhubsrorscx3aua5k5i4f642pgvp4tywxsvlgga6a",
            "attributes": {},
            "annotations": [
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [104],
                "ends": [111],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/811"
              },
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [116],
                "ends": [123],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/horacioh/seed/commit/041cb6b01ad0da5d571028ee9050fe3bc1743a40"
              },
              {
                "type": "Code",
                "starts": [123],
                "ends": [131],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": ""
              }
            ],
            "text": "Added DigiCert KeyLocker signing for Windows builds, then tuned the development workflow around it. See PR #811 and commit 041cb6b0.",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [],
          "block": {
            "type": "Paragraph",
            "id": "tEQs7UoS",
            "revision": "bafyreia7bwnixljpmmhubsrorscx3aua5k5i4f642pgvp4tywxsvlgga6a",
            "attributes": {},
            "annotations": [
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [270],
                "ends": [277],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/815"
              },
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [279],
                "ends": [286],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/816"
              },
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [292],
                "ends": [299],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/818"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Fixed editor rough edges around image captions, query placeholders, and autosave. Caption clicks no longer select the whole image block, query new-doc placeholders hide when a banner is present, and draft snapshots preserve recoverable edits during autosave writes. See PR #815, PR #816, and PR #818.",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [],
          "block": {
            "type": "Paragraph",
            "id": "9VOUnObH",
            "revision": "bafyreia7bwnixljpmmhubsrorscx3aua5k5i4f642pgvp4tywxsvlgga6a",
            "attributes": {},
            "annotations": [
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [206],
                "ends": [213],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/817"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Replaced separate move and republish flows with a unified destination dialog on desktop. This gave document relocation a clearer mental model and added tests for child path handling and republish refs. See PR #817.",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [],
          "block": {
            "type": "Paragraph",
            "id": "lEuWAcXq",
            "revision": "bafyreia7bwnixljpmmhubsrorscx3aua5k5i4f642pgvp4tywxsvlgga6a",
            "attributes": {},
            "annotations": [
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [176],
                "ends": [183],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed/pull/821"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Added writer promotion for site members, including account canonicalization so delegate aliases dedupe to root accounts and writer grants win over regular membership rows. See PR #821.",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [],
          "block": {
            "type": "Paragraph",
            "id": "ELDPWYJt",
            "revision": "bafyreia7bwnixljpmmhubsrorscx3aua5k5i4f642pgvp4tywxsvlgga6a",
            "attributes": {},
            "annotations": [
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [92],
                "ends": [99],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/horacioh/seed/commit/297dcb5beee874ca205420c87f59922bc9fc2c53"
              },
              {
                "type": "Code",
                "starts": [99, 119],
                "ends": [107, 127],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": ""
              },
              {
                "type": "Link",
                "starts": [112],
                "ends": [119],
                "attributes": {},
                "link": "https://github.com/horacioh/seed/commit/ad831d68f7686ae16b54726c61f8505537f33ec2"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Added frontend UI polish agent guidance and pinned formatting behavior across the repo. See commit 297dcb5b and commit ad831d68.",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "block": {
